{"availability":"available","full":"dshakes/distil","name":"distil","description":"Compression with a quality contract — cache-aware, causally-pruned LLM context compression for agentic runtimes, certified non-inferior across 7 domains. Works with any SDK.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":19,"forks":3,"created":"2026-06-21T17:17:24Z","updated":"2026-10-08T09:26:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://dshakes.github.io/distil/","topics":["agents","ai-infrastructure","anthropic","claude-code","conformal-prediction","context-compression","cost-optimization","llm","llmops","mcp","openai","prompt-caching","token-optimization"],"demo":"https://dshakes.github.io/distil/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.092Z","stars":18,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","stars":19,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Distil is the compressor that tells you when it is hurting you —and measures any other compressor, or your provider's own compaction, the same way.","Other installs (curl, Homebrew, pipx, Windows): Install your way","What the measurements say today (2026-10-06; every figure links to its artifact)"],"features":["On short coding tasks no compressor is shown to save money. SWE-bench Lite, 298 tasks, same model and grader: distil is at parity with no compression ($0.0393 vs $0.0387 per solved task). RTK looked 20.7% cheaper per…","Long sessions: inconclusive. A 7-task long-horizon pilot (median 63–69 steps) shows no cost difference for distil or RTK; on the 6 tasks without one crashed attempt, distil cost 9.7% more than plain. Run →","Why. An offline simulator that reproduces the provider's bill within 2.5% on runs it never saw finds that lossless policies change cost by less than 0.2%, and that lossy compression saves money only if the agent does…","On the maintainer's own metered Claude Code traffic (13,191 requests, September 2026) distil removed an estimated 8.3–9.2% of the bill, cache priced in, its own spend netted out (source, method). That is a…","It doesn't break your prompt cache. Distil never rewrites bytes the provider still has cached; older context changes only once that cache has already expired. We shipped that bug once, measured what it cost, and made…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f92c89decb85ab53e1633fd77f9ee2a89bb0ce88542bdc2c283a2327f8cb1747","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:40:44.359Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:40:44.359Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Distil is the compressor that tells you when it is hurting you —and measures any other compressor, or your provider's own compaction, the same way.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"It needs no API key and no spend, so it is wired into make gate and the CI gate job rather than run before a launch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"You usually don't need to pick. distil onboard detects your billing and sets the right mode for you — it writes it into your setup so every session just works.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"40+ shipped capabilities, all real (no stubs): the cache-aware cost engine, causal pruning, the TOST gate + conformal certificate, the proxy + Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini first-class adapters (Chat Completions, Responses API, and Gemini generateContent), an MCP server, LiteLLM/LangChain/LangGraph hooks, per-agent wrap presets, the Proof Ledger end-of-session printout, the…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f92c89decb85ab53e1633fd77f9ee2a89bb0ce88542bdc2c283a2327f8cb1747","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:40:44.361Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T09:26:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:40:44.366Z","hash":"f92c89decb85ab53e1633fd77f9ee2a89bb0ce88542bdc2c283a2327f8cb1747","originalBytes":105912,"storedBytes":105912,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["distil","every","tool","agent","model","one","docs","what","wrap","savings","own","claude","python","same","never","proxy","only","digest","live","expand","distil-llm","install","run","against","default","compression","output","real","benchmarks","code","results","adr","mcp","cache","runs","gate","measured","read","turn","tokens","bash","cost","examples","compress","full","anthropic","context","corpus","it.","per","url","base","gemini","line","provider","recall","still","tasks","there","traffic","any","mode","nothing","now","pass","request","when","client","does","keeps","pip","see","session","shadow","which","cli","openai","point","research","reversible","through","two","api","bench","just","path","sdk","shows","verbatim","why","certificate","certify","each","fail","lossy","messages","next","offline","over","rather","reads","subscription","task","because","change","hook","other","swe-bench","without","back","before","certified","decision-equivalence","gateway","key","lossless","most","once","paired","prefix","setup","shell","where","zero","budget","codex","coding","handle","how","instead","json","number","original","out","saved","sessions","bill","bytes","command","compressor","content","doesn","file","lossless-only","old","pipx","prompt","proof","raw","shipped","success","about","check","config","exactly","floor","get","graded","keep","list","local","name","package","reports","requests","result","schema","status","t